+## 77. Green County (Dhaval) test calls 1060/1061/1073: Swarit came from the customer memory, Hindi callback requests were invisible, the good-time beat was rolled back (2026-10-12) — IMPLEMENTED, NOT DEPLOYED, awaiting review
